{"bankId":"B-SRC-46-3163","section":"BAHAGIAN B","domain":"Matematik","repairType":"MATERIAL_REWRITE_CORE_DUPLICATE","reviewStatus":"EDITORIAL_REPAIRED_PENDING_QA","sourceDuplicateFamily":"B-CORE-DUP-0001","constructFamily":"supplementary_angles_ratio","plannedLevel":3,"question":"Dua sudut bersebelahan pada garis lurus mempunyai nisbah 4:5. Berapakah sudut yang lebih kecil?","options":["72°","80°","90°","100°"],"answerIndex":1,"solutionSteps":["Jumlah nisbah = 4 + 5 = 9 bahagian bersamaan 180°.","Sudut kecil = 4/9 × 180° = 80°."]}
{"bankId":"B-SRC-46-3164","section":"BAHAGIAN B","domain":"Matematik","repairType":"MATERIAL_REWRITE_CORE_DUPLICATE","reviewStatus":"EDITORIAL_REPAIRED_PENDING_QA","sourceDuplicateFamily":"B-CORE-DUP-0013","constructFamily":"coordinate_reverse_start_point","plannedLevel":2,"question":"Sebuah titik bergerak 7 unit ke kanan dan berakhir pada koordinat (12,4). Apakah koordinat asal titik itu?","options":["(3,4)","(4,5)","(5,4)","(19,4)"],"answerIndex":2,"solutionSteps":["Gerakan ke kanan menambah nilai x sebanyak 7.","Koordinat asal x = 12 − 7 = 5 dan y kekal 4, jadi (5,4)."]}
{"bankId":"B-SRC-47-3221","section":"BAHAGIAN B","domain":"Matematik","repairType":"MATERIAL_REWRITE_CORE_DUPLICATE","reviewStatus":"EDITORIAL_REPAIRED_PENDING_QA","sourceDuplicateFamily":"B-CORE-DUP-0002","constructFamily":"division_after_reserve_stock","plannedLevel":3,"question":"Sebuah gudang mempunyai 410 kotak kecil. Sebanyak 26 disimpan sebagai stok kecemasan. Baki dimuatkan 32 kotak kecil bagi setiap palet. Berapakah palet penuh yang terhasil?","options":["10 palet","11 palet","13 palet","12 palet"],"answerIndex":3,"solutionSteps":["Baki = 410 − 26 = 384.","384 ÷ 32 = 12 palet penuh."]}
{"bankId":"B-SRC-47-3222","section":"BAHAGIAN B","domain":"Matematik","repairType":"MATERIAL_REWRITE_CORE_DUPLICATE","reviewStatus":"EDITORIAL_REPAIRED_PENDING_QA","sourceDuplicateFamily":"B-CORE-DUP-0003","constructFamily":"fraction_replenish_after_consumption","plannedLevel":3,"question":"Rajah menunjukkan 5/8 daripada sebuah kek telah dimakan. Kemudian 1/4 daripada keseluruhan kek ditambah dengan kek baharu yang sama saiz bahagian. Apakah pecahan kek yang ada sekarang?","options":["5/8","3/8","1/2","7/8"],"answerIndex":0,"solutionSteps":["Baki kek asal = 1 − 5/8 = 3/8.","Tambah 1/4 = 2/8, jadi jumlah = 3/8 + 2/8 = 5/8."],"visual":{"kind":"fraction_bar","parts":8,"selected":5}}
{"bankId":"B-SRC-47-3224","section":"BAHAGIAN B","domain":"Matematik","repairType":"MATERIAL_REWRITE_CORE_DUPLICATE","reviewStatus":"EDITORIAL_REPAIRED_PENDING_QA","sourceDuplicateFamily":"B-CORE-DUP-0004","constructFamily":"reverse_percentage_after_increase","plannedLevel":3,"question":"Harga sebuah alat meningkat 25% menjadi RM150. Berapakah harga sebelum kenaikan?","options":["RM112","RM120","RM125","RM130"],"answerIndex":1,"solutionSteps":["RM150 mewakili 125% daripada harga asal.","Harga asal = 150 ÷ 1.25 = RM120."]}
{"bankId":"B-SRC-47-3225","section":"BAHAGIAN B","domain":"Matematik","repairType":"MATERIAL_REWRITE_CORE_DUPLICATE","reviewStatus":"EDITORIAL_REPAIRED_PENDING_QA","sourceDuplicateFamily":"B-CORE-DUP-0005","constructFamily":"ratio_after_removal_solve_original","plannedLevel":4,"question":"Nisbah pensel merah kepada biru ialah 5:4. Jika 10 pensel merah dikeluarkan, nisbah menjadi 5:6. Berapakah bilangan pensel merah pada asalnya?","options":["20","25","30","40"],"answerIndex":2,"solutionSteps":["Ambil bilangan asal sebagai 5k merah dan 4k biru. Selepas 10 merah dikeluarkan: (5k − 10):4k = 5:6.","6(5k − 10)=20k, jadi 10k=60 dan k=6. Merah asal = 5×6 = 30."]}
